[28.336883, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;174m▝▜\u001b[48;5;16m█████\u001b[49m█▀\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241mHaiku 4.5 · Claude API\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241m~/b/billing\u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  Get to finished work\u001b[24Gsooner\u001b[31Gwith\u001b[36GOpus\u001b[41G5.5.\u001b[46GSwitch\u001b[53Ganytime\u001b[61Gwith\u001b[66G\u001b[38;5;105m/model\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in app/money.py \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mdrops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half up (for example, \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16m7% tax on 1050 cents must be 74\u001b[35Gcents, not 73). te\u001b[54Gts/test_money.py pins \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe required behaviour; you can run it\u001b[42Gwith\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest \u001b[39m          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105mtests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m.\u001b[24GFix it and\u001b[35Gt\u001b[37Gll me when it\u001b[51Gis done. Do not commit; \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mdo not push.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll examine the failing test and fix the rounding issue in \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLet me check the\u001b[20Gtax\u001b[24Gfunction\u001b[33Gto\u001b[36Gunderstand\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gfull\u001b[56Gcontext:\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I'll fix the \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m function\u001b[41Gto\u001b[44Guse\u001b[48Ghalf-up\u001b[56Grounding:\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u